# Documentation and local reports stay outside Git by owner decision.
**/*.md
!/README.md
**/*.pdf
**/*.docx
**/*.odt
**/*.rtf
docs/
reports/
.agent/feature-list.json

# Local configuration and secrets.
.env
.env.*
config
config.*
*.key
*.pem

